       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. W04.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-TABLE.
           05 WS-ITEM OCCURS 10 TIMES INDEXED BY IDX PIC 9(2).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           PERFORM VARYING IDX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL IDX > 10
               MOVE IDX TO WS-ITEM(IDX)
           END-PERFORM.
           SET IDX TO 1.
           SET IDX UP BY 3.
           DISPLAY "IDX-AFTER-UP3=" IDX " VAL=" WS-ITEM(IDX).
           SET IDX DOWN BY 2.
           DISPLAY "IDX-AFTER-DOWN2=" IDX " VAL=" WS-ITEM(IDX).
           STOP RUN.
